  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your memory for magic allows you to refocus your mystic preparations with ease.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Rememorize<sup>CAF</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you use this feat, you can change a number of additional prepared spells equal to your mythic tier for other spells you know of the same or lower level. If you expend one use of mythic power, you can do this even if you do not have access to your spellbook, holy symbol, or other materials normally required to prepare spells.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-n-s-feats#toc25\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
